#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:13
msgid "Claude Code — Hermes Orchestration Guide"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:15
msgid ""
"Delegate coding tasks to [Claude Code](https://code.claude.com/docs/en"
"/cli-reference) (Anthropic's autonomous coding agent CLI) via the Hermes "
"terminal. Claude Code v2.x can read files, write code, run shell "
"commands, spawn subagents, and manage git workflows autonomously."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:17
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:19
msgid "**Install:** `npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:20
msgid ""
"**Auth:** run `claude` once to log in (browser OAuth for Pro/Max, or set "
"`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:21
msgid "**Console auth:** `claude auth login --console` for API key billing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:22
msgid "**SSO auth:** `claude auth login --sso` for Enterprise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:23
msgid ""
"**Check status:** `claude auth status` (JSON) or `claude auth status "
"--text` (human-readable)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:24
msgid ""
"**Health check:** `claude doctor` — checks auto-updater and installation "
"health"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:25
msgid "**Version check:** `claude --version` (requires v2.x+)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:26
msgid "**Update:** `claude update` or `claude upgrade`"
msgstr ""

