msgid "Mode 1: Print Mode (`-p`) — Non-Interactive (PREFERRED for most tasks)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:34
msgid ""
"Print mode runs a one-shot task, returns the result, and exits. No PTY "
"needed. No interactive prompts. This is the cleanest integration path."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:40
msgid "**When to use print mode:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:41
msgid "One-shot coding tasks (fix a bug, add a feature, refactor)"
