#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:704
msgid "Cost & Performance Tips"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:706
msgid ""
"**Use `--max-turns`** in print mode to prevent runaway loops. Start with "
"5-10 for most tasks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:707
msgid ""
"**Use `--max-budget-usd`** for cost caps. Note: minimum ~$0.05 for system"
" prompt cache creation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:708
msgid ""
"**Use `--effort low`** for simple tasks (faster, cheaper). `high` or "
"`max` for complex reasoning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:709
msgid "**Use `--bare`** for CI/scripting to skip plugin/hook discovery overhead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:710
msgid ""
"**Use `--allowedTools`** to restrict to only what's needed (e.g., `Read` "
"only for reviews)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:711
msgid "**Use `/compact`** in interactive sessions when context gets large."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:712
msgid ""
"**Pipe input** instead of having Claude read files when you just need "
"analysis of known content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:713
msgid ""
"**Use `--model haiku`** for simple tasks (cheaper) and `--model opus` for"
" complex multi-step work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:714
msgid ""
"**Use `--fallback-model haiku`** in print mode to gracefully handle model"
" overload."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:715
msgid ""
"**Start new sessions for distinct tasks** — sessions last 5 hours; fresh "
"context is more efficient."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:716
msgid ""
"**Use `--no-session-persistence`** in CI to avoid accumulating saved "
"sessions on disk."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:718
msgid "Pitfalls & Gotchas"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:720
msgid ""
"**Interactive mode REQUIRES tmux** — Claude Code is a full TUI app. Using"
" `pty=true` alone in Hermes terminal works but tmux gives you `capture-"
"pane` for monitoring and `send-keys` for input, which is essential for "
"orchestration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:721
msgid ""
"**`--dangerously-skip-permissions` dialog defaults to \"No, exit\"** — "
"you must send Down then Enter to accept. Print mode (`-p`) skips this "
"entirely."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:722
msgid ""
"**`--max-budget-usd` minimum is ~$0.05** — system prompt cache creation "
"alone costs this much. Setting lower will error immediately."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:723
msgid "**`--max-turns` is print-mode only** — ignored in interactive sessions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:724
msgid ""
"**Claude may use `python` instead of `python3`** — on systems without a "
"`python` symlink, Claude's bash commands will fail on first try but it "
"self-corrects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:725
msgid ""
"**Session resumption requires same directory** — `--continue` finds the "
"most recent session for the current working directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:726
msgid ""
"**`--json-schema` needs enough `--max-turns`** — Claude must read files "
"before producing structured output, which takes multiple turns."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:727
msgid ""
"**Trust dialog only appears once per directory** — first-time only, then "
"cached."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:728
msgid ""
"**Background tmux sessions persist** — always clean up with `tmux kill-"
"session -t <name>` when done."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:729
msgid ""
"**Slash commands (like `/commit`) only work in interactive mode** — in "
"`-p` mode, describe the task in natural language instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:730
msgid ""
"**`--bare` skips OAuth** — requires `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` env var or an "
"`apiKeyHelper` in settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:731
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Context degradation is real** — AI output quality measurably degrades "
"above 70% context window usage. Monitor with `/context` and proactively "
"`/compact`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:733
msgid "Rules for Hermes Agents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:735
msgid ""
"**Prefer print mode (`-p`) for single tasks** — cleaner, no dialog "
"handling, structured output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:736
msgid ""
"**Use tmux for multi-turn interactive work** — the only reliable way to "
"orchestrate the TUI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:737
msgid ""
"**Always set `workdir`** — keep Claude focused on the right project "
"directory"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:738
msgid ""
"**Set `--max-turns` in print mode** — prevents infinite loops and runaway"
" costs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:739
msgid ""
"**Monitor tmux sessions** — use `tmux capture-pane -t <session> -p -S "
"-50` to check progress"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:740
msgid ""
"**Look for the `❯` prompt** — indicates Claude is waiting for input (done"
" or asking a question)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:741
msgid "**Clean up tmux sessions** — kill them when done to avoid resource leaks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:742
msgid ""
"**Report results to user** — after completion, summarize what Claude did "
"and what changed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:743
msgid ""
"**Don't kill slow sessions** — Claude may be doing multi-step work; check"
" progress instead"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/claude-code_SKILL.md:744
msgid ""
"**Use `--allowedTools`** — restrict capabilities to what the task "
"actually needs"
msgstr ""

